# Sixth ASB screen (scripts/screen_hermes_asb.sh, 3 runs): naive observation prompt injection
# with ASB's non-aggressive attacker tools outside academic_search. screen-asb-5 found that no
# attack type (naive, combined_attack, context_ignoring, fake_completion) gets an aggressive tool
# called (0/132, injection delivered); the one OPI tool that works elsewhere,
# CredentialVerificationTool, is non-aggressive. Four tools per agent whose names do not match
# the agent's task-0 job, so the clean control is less likely to call them.
